abstract: >-
  Research software and reproducibility records for matched local-position
  and reconstruction features in direct forecasting, together with related
  residual-forecasting and policy studies and earlier Kernel Affine Hull
  Koopman Machine experiments. Each study retains its own sampling units,
  source identity, and analysis contract.
keywords:
